Error [E0984]: `when` is no longer a keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/foreign_switch_case.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     when 1 {
    |     ^^^^
 Why: `if` is the one branching keyword — multi-arm dispatch is `if subject == { arm -> body }`
 Fix: write `if subject == { value -> body … }` (an `else -> body` catch-all)

Error [E0023]: `if` arms are written `value -> body`, not `case`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_switch_case.jet:3:9
    |
  3 |         case 1 -> { print("x"); };
    |         ^^^^
 Why: choosing one branch from many uses `if` with `->` arms (D-IF1)
 Fix: replace `case` with a value or condition and `->`, like `1 -> body`
